md=['# Operad skills audit — in progress','',f"Pinned source: `{r['source_commit']}`. Reviewed {r['full_source_read_count']}/{r['scope_count']} full bodies; {len(r['remaining_work'])} remain. Source bytes preserved; only this audit prefix is written.",'','The strongest reusable material is claim hygiene, exact evidence custody, typed input refusal, task-aware guard transfer and review handoffs. Templates and prose obligations do not themselves establish mathematical structures or enforced workflow gates.','',f"Current synthesis: {len(r['claims'])} claims and {len(r['findings'])} findings. Six tiny controls observed their stated outcomes; one shell control could not start because MSYS denied initialization. Historical tests and witness narratives are not new execution.",'']
